  "verbalization": "Nandrolone Decanoate is implicated in the activation of Ar through a chain of molecular interactions involving Oxandrolone. The evidence suggests that Nandrolone Decanoate causes physiological effects such as Peliosis Hepatis, Virilism, and Testicular Atrophy, all of which are mediated by Oxandrolone. Oxandrolone, in turn, binds to Ar, indicating a direct interaction between the two entities. The lowest common ancestor of these relationships is the Organooxygen Compound, which links Nandrolone Decanoate and Oxandrolone to the therapeutic and androgenic properties of the compound. This suggests that Nandrolone Decanoate may influence Ar through a mechanism involving Oxandrolone, potentially through a shared biological pathway or molecular interaction. The evidence supports a causal relationship between Nandrolone Decanoate and Ar, mediated by Oxandrolone, highlighting the role of androgenic compounds in modulating Ar activity.",
